---
import { FRONTS } from '../data/content';
import Symbol from './Symbol.astro';
---
<section class="svc section" id="servicos" aria-labelledby="svc-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="svc__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Serviços</p>
        <h2 class="h2 svc__title" id="svc-title" data-reveal>
          Um time. Quatro frentes. <span class="serif lit">Um plano.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--d:.1s">
        Você não precisa de mais um fornecedor de posts ou anúncios. Precisa de uma equipe que estruture o marketing
        inteiro — e faça cada frente trabalhar a favor da outra.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="svc__list" data-accordion>
      {
        FRONTS.map((f, i) => (
          <li class={`front ${i === 0 ? 'is-open' : ''}`} data-reveal style={`--d:${i * 0.06}s`}>
            <h3 class="front__h">
              <button
                class="front__btn"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                aria-controls={`front-${f.id}`}
                id={`front-btn-${f.id}`}
                data-front={f.id}
              >
                <span class="front__n">{f.n}</span>
                <span class="front__name">{f.name}</span>
                <span class="front__promise">{f.promise}</span>
                <span class="front__tags" aria-hidden="true">
                  {f.services.map((s) => <span>{s.title}</span>)}
                </span>
                <span class="front__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span>
              </button>
            </h3>
            <div class="front__panel" id={`front-${f.id}`} role="region" aria-labelledby={`front-btn-${f.id}`}>
              <div class="front__inner">
                <div class="front__body">
                  <p class="front__intro">{f.intro}</p>
                  <div class="front__grid" style={`--cols:${f.services.length}`}>
                    {f.services.map((s) => (
                      <article class="svc-item">
                        <h4 class="svc-item__t">{s.title}</h4>
                        <p class="svc-item__d">{s.description}</p>
                        <p class="svc-item__label">O que entregamos</p>
                        <ul class="svc-item__list">
                          {s.deliverables.map((d) => <li>{d}</li>)}
                        </ul>
                        <div class="svc-item__impact">
                          <p class="svc-item__label">Impacto no seu negócio</p>
                          <p>{s.impact}</p>
                        </div>
                        <a class="link-arrow svc-item__cta" href="#diagnostico" data-interest={s.title} data-cta="servico">
                          Começar por aqui
                          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
                        </a>
                      </article>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <Symbol class="front__sym" part={i % 2 === 0 ? 'bowl' : 'stem'} />
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div class="svc__foot" data-reveal>
      <p>Não sabe por qual frente começar? <strong>É exatamente para isso que existe o diagnóstico.</strong></p>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="#diagnostico" data-cta="servicos-diagnostico">
        Descobrir por onde começar
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .svc {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--black), var(--ink));
  }
  .svc__head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }
  .svc__title {
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 13ch;
  }
  .svc__list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .front {
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .front::before {
    /* luz que nasce do canto inferior esquerdo */
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -10%;
    bottom: -60%;
    width: 60%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgb(254 67 77 / 0.22), rgb(234 104 50 / 0.1) 50%, transparent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.6s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .front:hover::before,
  .front.is-open::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .front__h {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .front__btn {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, auto) 1fr 56px;
    grid-template-areas:
      'n name promise icon'
      'n tags tags icon';
    align-items: center;
    column-gap: 24px;
    row-gap: 10px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 40px) 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .front__n {
    grid-area: n;
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 0.9em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--mute-2);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .front__name {
    grid-area: name;
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7.4vw, 7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 0.9;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-out), color 0.4s;
  }
  .front__btn:hover .front__name {
    transform: translateX(10px);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__name {
    background: var(--sun);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .front__promise {
    grid-area: promise;
    justify-self: end;
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem);
    color: var(--mute);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .front__tags {
    grid-area: tags;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .front__tags span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--mute);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-strong);
  }
  .front__icon {
    grid-area: icon;
    justify-self: end;
    position: relative;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-strong);
    transition: background 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s, transform 0.6s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .front__icon i {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 16px;
    height: 1.5px;
    margin: -0.75px 0 0 -8px;
    background: var(--text);
    transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease-out), background 0.3s;
  }
  .front__icon i:last-child {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  .front__btn:hover .front__icon {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--orange);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__icon {
    background: var(--orange);
    box-shadow: none;
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__icon i {
    background: var(--black);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__icon i:last-child {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }
  .front__panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    transition: grid-template-rows 0.7s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__panel {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
  }
  .front__inner {
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 0;
  }
  .front__body {
    padding: 0 0 clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px) 88px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s, transform 0.7s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .front.is-open .front__body {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    transition-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .front__intro {
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: #c9c5c0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .front__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols), minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .svc-item {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 28px 32px 8px 0;
  }
  .svc-item + .svc-item {
    padding-left: 32px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .svc-item__t {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .svc-item__d {
    color: var(--mute);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .svc-item__label {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute-2);
  }
  .svc-item__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 16px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .svc-item__list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .svc-item__list li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 8px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    background: var(--sun);
  }
  .svc-item__impact {
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(255 106 0 / 0.09), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.02));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 106 0 / 0.16);
  }
  .svc-item__impact p:last-child {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .svc-item__cta {
    margin-top: auto;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .front__sym {
    position: absolute;
    right: -6%;
    bottom: -30%;
    width: 38%;
    opacity: 0.07;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .svc__foot {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px 32px;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .svc__foot strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .front__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .svc-item,
    .svc-item + .svc-item {
      padding: 26px 0 18px;
      border-left: 0;
    }
    .svc-item + .svc-item {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .svc__head {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .front__btn {
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr 48px;
      grid-template-areas:
        'n name icon'
        'n promise icon'
        'n tags tags';
      column-gap: 12px;
    }
    .front__promise {
      justify-self: start;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .front__icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
    }
    .front__body {
      padding-left: 0;
    }
    .front__tags {
      gap: 2px 0;
    }
    .front__tags span {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .front__tags span:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: '·';
      margin: 0 8px;
      color: var(--mute-2);
    }
  }
</style>
